# ============================================================
#  JatunWasi Ñawpaqay - .gitignore (proyecto Unreal Engine 5.7)
#  Se versiona: el trabajo propio (Content/JWN), Config, Scripts_Tesis,
#  el .uproject y el codigo del plugin. Se EXCLUYE: artefactos de build
#  (se regeneran solos) y los packs de terceros gigantes (se reimportan).
# ============================================================

# --- Maquinaria del plugin MCP (toolchain Go + cache, NO es la tesis) ---
External/

# --- Backups sueltos del .uproject ---
*.backup_*

# --- Artefactos de build de Unreal (se regeneran, NO versionar) ---
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.suo
.vs/
.vscode/

# --- Artefactos de build dentro de plugins ---
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# --- Paquetes / instaladores (enormes, NO versionar) ---
*.apk
*.obb
*.zip

# --- Datos de iluminacion horneada y backups (se regeneran) ---
*_BuiltData.uasset
*_BuiltData.uasset.bak
*.bak

# ============================================================
#  Packs de TERCEROS (estaticos, gigantes, reimportables).
#  NO se versionan para que el repo sea manejable (< 1 GB).
#  Estan respaldados en sus .zip y en el marketplace.
#  Si clonas en limpio: reimportar estos packs para abrir el proyecto.
# ============================================================
Content/StylescapeHD/
Content/Megascans/
Content/MSPresets/
Content/TileableForestRoad/
Content/XRMannequins/
Content/Weapons/
Content/VRTemplate/
Content/VRSpectator/
Content/XRFramework/
Content/LevelPrototyping/

# --- Config de herramientas (no es la tesis) ---
.claude/
.codex/

# Backups locales de mapas (seguridad, no versionar)
*_BACKUP_PRE_*.umap
